hadiths[85]{hadithnumber,text}:
"567","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Paanch ooqiya se kam mein sadqa nahi, paanch oonton se kam mein sadqa nahi, aur paanch wasaq se kam mein sadqa nahi."
"568","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman par us ke ghode aur ghulam mein sadqa nahi hai."
"569","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sadqe ka hukm farmaya. To kaha gaya: Ibn Jamil, Khalid bin al-Walid aur Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib ne rok liya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Jamil ko is ke siwa kya bura lagta hai ke wo faqeer tha to Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne use ghani kar diya. Aur raha Khalid, tum Khalid par zulm karte ho. Us ne apni zirehein aur hathyar Allah ke raste mein rok rakhe hain. Aur raha Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib, jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chacha hain, to wo us par sadqa hai aur us ke sath is jaisa."
"570","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Sadqa-e-Fitr farz farmaya: Khajoor ka ek sa', ya jau ka ek sa', har aazad ya ghulam, mard ya aurat par, Musalmanon mein se."
"571","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Sadqa-e-Fitr ka hukm farmaya: Khajoor ka ek sa' ya jau ka ek sa'. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Phir logon ne us ke barabar gehu ke do mudd kar diye."
"572","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Sadqa-e-Fitr nikalte: Khane ka ek sa', ya jau ka ek sa', ya khajoor ka ek sa', ya paneer ka ek sa', ya kishmish ka ek sa'."
"573","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein dete: Khane ka ek sa', ya khajoor ka ek sa', ya jau ka ek sa', ya kishmish ka ek sa'. Phir jab Muawiya aaye aur gehu aayi to unhon ne kaha: Main samajhta hun ke is ka ek mudd do mudd ke barabar hai."
"574","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghode teen ke liye hain: Ek shakhs ke liye ajr, ek ke liye parda, aur ek par bojh. Raha jis ke liye ajr hai, to ek shakhs jis ne use Allah ke raste mein bandha aur charagah ya sabze mein lambi rassi se bandha. Phir jo us ki lambi rassi mein us charagah ya sabze se lage wo us ke liye nekiyan thein. Aur agar wo apni rassi tod kar ek ya do teelon par daudta to us ki leed aur nishan us ke liye nekiyan hote. Aur agar wo nahar par guzarta aur us mein se peeta jabke us ne use pilana na chaha ho to wo us ke liye nekiyan hota. Aur ek shakhs jis ne use fakhr, riyakari aur Ahle Islam se dushmani ke liye bandha to wo us par bojh hai. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se gadhon ke bare mein poochha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujh par is mein is jami mani munfarid ayat ke siwa kuchh nazil nahi hua [jo zarre ke wazan ke barabar bhalayi karega use dekhega, aur jo zarre ke wazan ke barabar burayi karega use dekhega]."
"575","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aap ke paas pahuncha jabke Wo Kaaba ke saye mein farma rahe they: Wo nuqsan wale hain, Kaaba ke Rab ki qasam! Wo nuqsan wale hain, Kaaba ke Rab ki qasam! Main ne kaha: Mera kya haal hai? Kya mujh mein koi cheez dekhi jati hai? Mera kya haal hai? Phir main Aap ke paas baitha jabke Wo farma rahe they. Phir main khamosh na reh saka, aur mujh par jo Allah ne chaha tari hua. Phir main ne kaha: Wo kaun hain, mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Maal mein zyada wale, magar jo aise aur aise aur aise kahe."
"576","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas pahuncha. Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Ya Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Ya jaisa qasam khayi. Jis shakhs ke paas oont, gaayen ya bakriyan hon aur wo un ka haq ada na kare magar Qayamat ke din unhe laya jayega sab se bade aur mote hokar. Wo use apne khuron se raundenge aur apne seengon se marenge. Jab bhi un mein se pichhli guzregi to pehli us par lautayi jayegi, yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye."
"577","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Madina ke pathrile ilaqe mein shaam ko chal raha tha. Uhud hamare samne aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr! Main pasand nahi karta ke Uhud mere liye sona ho, mujh par ek raat ya teen guzre jabke mere paas us mein se deenar ho magar use qarz ke liye rokun, magar ye ke use Allah ke bandon mein aise aur aise aur aise kahun. Aur Aap ne hamein apne hath se dikhaya. Phir farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr! Main ne arz kiya: Labbaik wa sa'daik Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Zyada wale kam wale hain, magar jo aise aur aise kahe. Phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Apni jagah raho, ae Abu Dharr! Na hato yahan tak ke main lautun. Phir Aap chale yahan tak ke mujh se ojhal ho gaye. Phir main ne awaz suni. To mujhe dar hua ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kuchh pesh aaya hai. Phir main ne jane ka irada kiya. Phir mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qaul yaad aaya ke na hato. Phir main thehra. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne awaz suni aur mujhe dar hua ke tumhe kuchh pesh aaya hai. Phir mujhe tumhara qaul yaad aaya. Phir main khada raha. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo Jibreel they. Wo mere paas aaye aur mujhe khabar di ke meri ummat mein se jo is haal mein mare ke wo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho."
"578","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ek raat nikla. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) akele chal rahe they, Aap ke sath koi insan na tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne gumaan kiya ke Wo na-pasand farmate hain ke koi Aap ke sath chale. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main chaand ke saye mein chalne laga. Phir Aap ne tawajjah ki aur mujhe dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Main ne arz kiya: Abu Dharr, Allah mujhe tum par fida kare. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr! Aao. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Aap ke sath kuchh der chala. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak zyada maal wale Qayamat ke din kam wale hain, magar jise Allah ne bhalayi di aur us ne us mein apne dayein, bayein, samne aur peechhe kharch kiya aur us mein bhalayi ki. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Aap ke sath kuchh der chala. Phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Yahan baitho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne mujhe khule maidan mein bithaya jis ke ird-gird pathar they. Phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Yahan baitho yahan tak ke main tumhare paas lautun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap pathrile ilaqe mein chale yahan tak ke main Aap ko na dekhun. Phir Aap mujh se door rahe aur der lagayi. Phir main ne Aap ko suna jabke Aap aa rahe they, aur Wo farma rahe they: Agarche us ne chori ki ho aur zina kiya ho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Aap aaye to main sabr na kar saka yahan tak ke main ne arz kiya: Ae Nabiullah! Allah mujhe tum par fida kare. Tum pathrile ilaqe ke kinare kis se kalam karte ho? Main ne kisi ko tumhe jawab dete nahi suna. Aap ne farmaya: Wo Jibreel (alaihissalam) they. Wo pathrile ilaqe ke kinare mere samne aaye. Unhon ne kaha: Apni ummat ko khush-khabri do ke jo is haal mein mare ke wo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Main ne kaha: Ae Jibreel! Agarche us ne chori ki ho aur zina kiya ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Agarche us ne chori ki ho aur zina kiya ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, agarche us ne sharab pi ho."
"579","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr se Ahnaf bin Qais ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Quraish ke ek majme ke paas baitha. Phir ek shakhs aaya jis ke baal, kapde aur haalat khushk they, yahan tak ke un par khada hua aur salam kiya. Phir kaha: Jama karne walon ko garam pathar ki khush-khabri do jo Jahannam ki aag mein garam kiya jayega, phir un mein se ek ke seene ki nok par rakha jayega yahan tak ke us ke kandhe ke jod se nikle, aur us ke kandhe ke jod par rakha jayega yahan tak ke us ke seene ki nok se nikle, hilta hua. Phir wo peeth pher kar gaya aur sutun ke paas baitha. Aur main us ke peechhe gaya aur us ke paas baitha, jabke main nahi janta tha wo kaun hai. Phir main ne us se kaha: Main qaum ko nahi dekhta magar unhon ne jo tum ne kaha na-pasand kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak wo kuchh nahi samajhte. Mere khalil ne mujh se kaha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Tumhara khalil kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Ae Abu Dharr! Kya tum Uhud dekhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne din mein jo baqi tha suraj ki taraf dekha, jabke main samajhta tha ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe apni ek hajat mein bhejenge. Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Main pasand nahi karta ke mere liye Uhud ke barabar sona ho aur main use kharch karun, siwaye teen deenaron ke. Aur beshak ye nahi samajhte. Wo to duniya jama karte hain. Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Main un se duniya nahi mangunga aur un se deen ke bare mein fatwa nahi mangunga yahan tak ke Allah se milun."
"580","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Kharch karo, tum par kharch kiya jayega. Aur farmaya: Allah ka hath bhara hua hai, kharch use kam nahi karta, raat aur din barsane wala. Aur farmaya: Kya tum ne dekha jo Us ne kharch kiya jab se Us ne aasman aur zameen paida kiye? Beshak us ne Us ke hath mein jo hai kam nahi kiya. Aur Us ka Arsh pani par tha. Aur Us ke hath mein tarazu hai, jhukata aur uthata hai."
"581","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi ke Aap ke sathiyon mein se ek shakhs ne tadbeer par ghulam aazad kiya, jabke us ke paas us ke siwa maal na tha. Phir Aap ne use aath sau dirham mein becha, phir us ki qeemat us ki taraf bheji."
"582","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha Madina mein Ansar mein khajooron se sab se zyada maal wale they. Aur un ke malon mein unhe sab se mehboob Bairuha tha. Aur wo masjid ke samne tha. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us mein dakhil hote aur us mein umda pani peete. Anas ne kaha: Phir jab ye ayat nazil hui [tum hargiz neki nahi paoge yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand karte ho] to Abu Talha Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khade hue aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala farmata hai [tum hargiz neki nahi paoge yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand karte ho]. Aur beshak mere malon mein mujhe sab se mehboob Bairuha hai. Aur beshak wo Allah ke liye sadqa hai. Main us ki bhalayi aur Allah ke paas us ke zakheere ki ummeed rakhta hun. Phir use Ya Rasulullah! Wahan rakho jahan Allah tumhe dikhaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wah! Ye nafa dene wala maal hai, ye nafa dene wala maal hai. Aur beshak main ne suna jo tum ne kaha. Aur beshak main dekhta hun ke tum use qareebi rishtedaron mein rakho. To Abu Talha ne kaha: Karunga Ya Rasulullah! Phir Abu Talha ne use apne rishtedaron aur chacha-zaad bhaiyon mein taqseem kiya."
"583","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni ek londi aazad ki. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Agar tum apne kuchh mamun se sila-rahmi kartin to tumhare ajr ke liye bada hota."
"584","[AI-translation] Abdullah ki biwi Zainab (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main masjid mein thi. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Sadqa karo agarche apne zewaron se. Aur Zainab Abdullah par aur apni god mein yateemon par kharch karti thein. Phir unhon ne Abdullah se kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochho: Kya mere liye kafi hai ke main tum par aur meri god mein yateemon par sadqe se kharch karun? To unhon ne kaha: Tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochho. Phir main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf chali. Phir main ne darwaze par Ansar ki ek aurat payi, us ki hajat meri hajat jaisi thi. Phir hum par Bilal guzre. To hum ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochho: Kya mere liye kafi hai ke main apne shohar aur meri god mein yateemon par kharch karun? Aur hum ne kaha: Hamein khabar na dena. Phir wo dakhil hue aur Aap se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Zainab. Aap ne farmaya: Kaun si Zainabein? Unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, us ke liye do ajr hain: Rishtedari ka ajr aur sadqe ka ajr."
"585","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya mere liye Abu Salama ke beton mein ajr hai ke main un par kharch karun, jabke main unhe aise aur aise nahi chhorne wali? Beshak wo mere bete hain. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, tumhare liye jo tum ne un par kharch kiya us ka ajr hai."
"586","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab Musalman apne ghar walon par kharch kare jabke wo us par sawab ki ummeed rakhta ho to wo us ke liye sadqa tha."
"587","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri walida mere paas aayein jabke wo mushrika thein, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein. Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se fatwa manga. Main ne arz kiya, jabke wo ragbat rakhti thein: Kya main apni walida se sila-rahmi karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, apni walida se sila-rahmi karo."
"588","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Beshak meri walida ki jaan achanak qabz ho gayi. Aur main gumaan karta hun ke agar wo bolteen to sadqa karteen. To kya un ke liye ajr hai agar main un ki taraf se sadqa karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"589","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqa hai. Unhon ne arz kiya: Phir agar na paye? Aap ne farmaya: Phir apne hathon se kaam kare, apne aap ko faida de aur sadqa kare. Unhon ne arz kiya: Phir agar taqat na rakhe ya na kare? Aap ne farmaya: Phir hajat-mand faryadi ki madad kare. Unhon ne arz kiya: Phir agar na kare? Aap ne farmaya: Phir bhalayi ka hukm de, ya farmaya: Neki ka. Unhon ne arz kiya: Phir agar na kare? Aap ne farmaya: Phir shar se ruke, kyunke ye us ke liye sadqa hai."
"590","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Logon ke har jod par sadqa hai, har din jis mein suraj tulu hota hai. Do ke darmiyan insaf kare sadqa hai. Aur aadmi ki us ki sawari par madad kare, use us par sawar kare ya us par us ka saman uthaye sadqa hai. Aur achhi baat sadqa hai. Aur har qadam jo wo namaz ki taraf uthaye sadqa hai. Aur takleef-deh cheez ko raste se hataye sadqa hai."
"591","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi din nahi jis mein bande subah karte hain magar do farishte nazil hote hain. Phir un mein se ek kehta hai: Ae Allah! Kharch karne wale ko badla de. Aur doosra kehta hai: Ae Allah! Rokne wale ko talaf de."
"592","[AI-translation] Hazrat Haritha bin Wahb (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Sadqa karo, kyunke tum par ek zamana aayega jab aadmi apna sadqa lekar chalega aur use qubool karne wala na payega. Aadmi kahega: Agar tum ise kal late to main use qubool karta. Raha aaj, mujhe is ki hajat nahi."
"593","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Logon par ek zamana zaroor aayega jis mein aadmi sone ka sadqa lekar phirega phir use koi na payega jo use us se le. Aur ek mard dekha jayega jis ke peechhe chalees aurtein hon, us se lipat-ti hui, mardon ki kami aur aurton ki zyadati se."
"594","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum mein maal zyada ho jaye. Phir behta phire yahan tak ke maal wale ko fikr ho ke us ka sadqa kaun qubool karega. Aur yahan tak ke use pesh kare. Phir jis par use pesh karega wo kahega: Mujhe is ki hajat nahi."
"595","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajoor ke barabar halal kamayi se sadqa kare, aur Allah ki taraf paak ke siwa kuchh nahi chadhta, to beshak Allah use apne dayan se qubool farmata hai. Phir use us ke malik ke liye palta hai jaise tum mein se ek apne bachhde ko palta hai, yahan tak ke wo pahad jaisa ho jaye."
"596","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Aag se bacho agarche khajoor ke tukde se."
"597","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahi magar Allah Qayamat ke din us se kalam farmayega, Allah aur us ke darmiyan tarjuman nahi hoga. Phir wo dekhega aur apne samne kuchh na dekhega. Phir apne samne dekhega to Aag us ka istiqbal karegi. Phir tum mein se jo Aag se bach sake agarche khajoor ke tukde se. Aur us se bhi riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aag se bacho. Phir Aap ne munh phera aur hata. Phir farmaya: Aag se bacho. Phir munh phera aur hata, teen martaba, yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke Wo use dekh rahe hain. Phir farmaya: Aag se bacho agarche khajoor ke tukde se. Phir jo na paye to achhi baat se."
"598","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hamein sadqe ka hukm diya gaya to hum bojh uthate. Phir Abu Aqil aadha sa' lekar aaya, aur ek insan us se zyada lekar aaya. To munafiqon ne kaha: Beshak Allah is ke sadqe se be-niyaz hai. Aur doosre ne ye sirf riyakari ke liye kiya. Phir ye nazil hui [jo tana dete hain khushi se dene walon ko mominon mein sadqon mein aur jo apni mehnat ke siwa nahi pate] ayat tak."
"599","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Umda doodh wali oontni ki ariyat kya hi achhi hai, aur umda doodh wali bakri, subah bartan se aur shaam bartan se."
"600","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bakheel aur sadqa karne wale ki misal do mardon jaisi bayan farmayi jin par lohe ke do jubbe hon, un ke dono hath un ke seenon aur hansliyon se majboor hon. Phir sadqa karne wala jab bhi sadqa karta us se kushada ho jata yahan tak ke us ki ungliyon ko dhanp le aur us ke nishan ko mitaye. Aur bakheel jab bhi sadqe ka irada karta wo simat jata, aur har halqa apni jagah pakad leta. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Wo apni ungli se aise apne gireban mein farmate. Phir agar tum Aap ko dekhte ke Wo use kushada farmate jabke wo kushada na hota."
"601","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Main zaroor sadqa karunga. Phir wo apna sadqa lekar nikla aur use chor ke hath mein rakha. Phir wo subah guftagu karne lage: Chor par sadqa kiya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Tere liye hamd hai. Main zaroor sadqa karunga. Phir wo apna sadqa lekar nikla aur use zaniya ke hathon mein rakha. Phir wo subah guftagu karne lage: Aaj raat zaniya par sadqa kiya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Tere liye hamd hai zaniya par. Main zaroor sadqa karunga. Phir wo apna sadqa lekar nikla aur use ghani ke hathon mein rakha. Phir wo subah guftagu karne lage: Ghani par sadqa kiya gaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Tere liye hamd hai chor, zaniya aur ghani par. Phir us ke paas aaya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Raha tumhara chor par sadqa, shayad wo apni chori se bache. Aur rahi zaniya, shayad wo apne zina se bache. Aur raha ghani, shayad wo ibrat le aur us mein se kharch kare jo Allah ne use diya."
"602","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman amanat-dar khazin jo nafiz karta hai, aur kabhi farmaya: Deta hai jo use hukm diya gaya poora aur mukammal, us par dil khush hote hue, phir use us ki taraf deta hai jis ke liye use hukm diya gaya, do sadqa karne walon mein se ek hai."
"603","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne ghar ke khane mein se kharch kare baghair bigade, to us ke liye us ka ajr hai jo us ne kharch kiya. Aur us ke shohar ke liye us ka ajr hai jo us ne kamaya. Aur khazin ke liye is jaisa. Un mein se ek doosre ka ajr kuchh kam nahi karta."
"604","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Aurat roza na rakhe jab us ka shohar hazir ho, magar us ki ijazat se."
"605","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne shohar ki kamayi mein se us ke hukm ke baghair kharch kare to us ke liye us ke ajr ka aadha hai."
"606","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke raste mein joda kharch kare use Jannat ke darwazon se pukara jayega: Ae Allah ke bande! Ye bhalayi hai. Phir jo namaz walon mein se ho use namaz ke darwaze se pukara jayega. Aur jo jihad walon mein se ho use jihad ke darwaze se pukara jayega. Aur jo roza walon mein se ho use Rayyan ke darwaze se pukara jayega. Aur jo sadqa walon mein se ho use sadqe ke darwaze se pukara jayega. To Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya: Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon Ya Rasulullah! Jisے un darwazon se pukara jaye us par zaroorat nahi. Phir kya koi un sab darwazon se pukara jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur main ummeed rakhta hun ke tum un mein se hoge."
"607","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke raste mein joda kharch kare use Jannat ke darban pukarege, har darwaze ke darban: Ae falan! Aao. Abu Bakr ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Wo hai jis par halakat nahi. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ummeed rakhta hun ke tum un mein se hoge."
"608","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kharch karo aur ginti na karo warna Allah tum par ginega. Aur na rok kar rakho warna Allah tum par rok kar rakhega."
"609","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Musalman aurton! Padosan padosan ko haqeer na samjhe agarche bakri ka khur ho."
"610","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Saat jinhe Allah apne saye mein saya dega jis din us ke saye ke siwa koi saya nahi: Adil imam, naujawan jo apne Rab ki ibadat mein pala-badha, aur shakhs jis ka dil masjiden mein atka ho, aur do shakhs jinhon ne Allah ke liye mohabbat ki, us par jama hue aur us par juda hue, aur shakhs jise mansab aur husn wali aurat bulaye to wo kahe ke main Allah se darta hun, aur shakhs jo chhup kar sadqa kare yahan tak ke us ka bayan na jane us ka dayan kya kharch karta hai, aur shakhs jo tanhayi mein Allah ko yaad kare aur us ki aankhein behne lagein."
"611","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa sadqa ajr mein sab se bada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum sadqa karo jabke tum tandurust, kanjoos ho, faqr se darte ho aur ghina ki ummeed rakhte ho. Aur mohlat na do yahan tak ke jab halaq tak pahunche to kaho ke falan ke liye itna, falan ke liye itna, jabke wo falan ka ho chuka."
"612","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par they, aur Aap ne sadqe, parhezgari aur mangne ka zikr farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai. Phir upar wala hath kharch karne wala hai, neeche wala mangne wala hai."
"613","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai. Aur us se ibtida karo jis ki tum kifalat karte ho. Aur behtar sadqa ghina ke baad hai. Aur jo parhez kare Allah use parhezgar banayega, aur jo be-niyaz ho Allah use ghani karega."
"614","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se manga to Aap ne mujhe diya. Phir main ne Aap se manga to Aap ne mujhe diya. Phir main ne Aap se manga to Aap ne mujhe diya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ae Hakim! Beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai. Phir jo use dil ki sakhavat se le us ke liye us mein barkat di jayegi. Aur jo use dil ke lalach se le us ke liye us mein barkat nahi di jayegi, us ki tarah jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota. Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai. Hakim ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhe haq ke sath bheja! Main tumhare baad kisi se koi cheez nahi mangunga yahan tak ke duniya se juda ho jaun. Phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) Hakim ko ata ki taraf bulate to wo us se qubool karne se inkar karte. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne use dene ke liye bulaya to us ne us se koi cheez qubool karne se inkar kiya. To Umar ne kaha: Beshak main tumhe gawah banata hun ae Musalmanon ki jamaat Hakim par ke main use is maal mein se us ka haq pesh karta hun aur wo lene se inkar karta hai. Phir Hakim ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad logon mein se kisi se kuchh na manga yahan tak ke faut ho gaye."
"615","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jis se Allah bhalayi chahta hai use deen mein samajh deta hai. Aur main to taqseem karne wala hun aur Allah deta hai. Aur ye ummat hamesha Allah ke hukm par qayam rahegi. Unhe wo nuqsan nahi dega jo un ki mukhalifat kare yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jaye."
"616","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi jo logon par phirta hai, use ek ya do luqme, ek ya do khajoorein lautati hain. Lekin miskeen wo hai jo ghina na paye jo use be-niyaz kare, na pehchana jaye ke us par sadqa kiya jaye, na khada ho kar logon se mange."
"617","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi logon se mangta rehta hai yahan tak ke Qayamat ke din aayega jabke us ke chehre mein gosht ka tukda nahi hoga."
"618","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni peeth par lakdiyon ka gattha uthaye ye is se behtar hai ke kisi se mange aur wo use de ya manع kare."
"619","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe ata dete to main arz karta: Use do jo mujh se zyada us ka mohtaj hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use lo. Jab tumhare paas is maal mein se koi cheez aaye jabke tum lalach karne wale aur mangne wale na ho to use lo. Aur jo na ho, us ke peechhe apne dil ko na lagao."
"620","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Budhe ka dil do mein jawan rehta hai: Duniya ki mohabbat aur lambi ummeed mein."
"621","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam budha hota hai aur us ke sath do budhe hote hain: Maal ki mohabbat aur lambi umar."
"622","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar Ibn Adam ke paas sone ki wadi ho to wo chahega ke us ke paas do wadiyan hon. Aur us ka munh mitti ke siwa kuchh nahi bharegi. Aur Allah us par tawajjah farmata hai jo tauba kare."
"623","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Agar Ibn Adam ke paas wadi bhar maal ho to wo chahega ke us ke paas us jaisa ho. Aur Ibn Adam ki aankh mitti ke siwa kuchh nahi bharti. Aur Allah us par tawajjah farmata hai jo tauba kare."
"624","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ghina saman ki kasrat se nahi, lekin ghina dil ka ghina hai."
"625","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo sab se zyada main tum par darta hun wo hai jo Allah tumhare liye zameen ki barkaton se nikalta hai. Arz kiya gaya: Zameen ki barkatein kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Duniya ki raunaq. Phir Aap se ek shakhs ne kaha: Kya bhalayi shar lekar aati hai? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khamosh ho gaye, yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke Aap par nazil ho raha hai. Phir Aap apni peshani se ponchhne lage. Phir farmaya: Sawal karne wala kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main hun. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Beshak hum ne us ki tareef ki jab wo zahir hua. Unhon ne kaha: Bhalayi shar ke siwa nahi lati. Beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai. Aur beshak jo bahar ugata hai wo pet phoolne se marta hai ya qareeb marta hai, magar sabza khane wali. Us ne khaya yahan tak ke jab us ki dono kokhein phail gayein to us ne suraj ka istiqbal kiya. Phir jugali ki, leed ki aur peshab kiya. Phir lauti aur khaya. Aur beshak ye maal meetha hai. Jo use us ke haq se le aur usے us ke haq mein rakhe to wo kya hi achha madadgar hai. Aur jo use us ke ghair haq se le wo us ki tarah tha jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota."
"626","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek din mimbar par baithe aur hum Aap ke ird-gird baithe. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak jo main tum par apne baad darta hun wo hai jo tum par duniya ki raunaq aur zeenat se khola jayega. Phir ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya bhalayi shar lekar aati hai? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khamosh ho gaye. To us se kaha gaya: Tumhara kya haal hai ke tum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kalam karte ho jabke Wo tum se kalam nahi karte? Phir hum ne dekha ke Aap par nazil ho raha hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne us se paseena ponchha. Phir farmaya: Sawal karne wala kahan hai? Goya Aap ne us ki tareef ki. Phir farmaya: Beshak bhalayi shar nahi lati. Aur beshak jo bahar ugata hai wo marta hai ya qareeb marta hai, magar sabza khane wali. Us ne khaya yahan tak ke jab us ki dono kokhein phail gayein to us ne suraj ki aankh ka istiqbal kiya. Phir leed ki, peshab kiya aur chari. Aur beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai. Phir Musalman ka kya hi acha sathi hai jo us mein se miskeen, yateem aur musafir ko de, ya jaisa Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya. Aur beshak jo use us ke ghair haq se le us ki tarah hai jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota. Aur wo Qayamat ke din us par gawah hoga."
"627","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se manga to Aap ne unhe diya. Phir unhon ne Aap se manga to Aap ne unhe diya, yahan tak ke jo Aap ke paas tha khatm ho gaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jo bhalayi mere paas hogi main use tum se bacha kar nahi rakhunga. Aur jo parhez kare Allah use parhezgar banayega. Aur jo be-niyaz ho Allah use ghani karega. Aur jo sabr kare Allah use sabir banayega. Aur kisi ko sabr se behtar aur wasee ata nahi di gayi."
"628","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Aal Muhammad ko rozi de."
"629","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath chal raha tha jabke Aap par Najran ki moti kinare wali chadar thi. Phir ek dehati Aap ko paya aur Aap ko zor se kheench liya, yahan tak ke main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke kandhe ka kinara dekha ke chadar ke kinare ne Aap par us ke zor se kheenchne se nishan dal diya tha. Phir us ne kaha: Mujhe Allah ke maal mein se hukm do jo tumhare paas hai. Phir Aap ne us ki taraf tawajjah ki aur hanse. Phir Aap ne us ke liye ata ka hukm farmaya."
"630","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miswar bin Makhrama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qabayein taqseem ki aur Makhraमा ko us mein se kuchh na diya. Phir Makhraमा ne kaha: Ae mere bete! Hamein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le chalo. Phir main us ke sath chala. Phir us ne kaha: Dakhil ho aur use mere liye bulao. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne use us ke liye bulaya. Phir Wo us ke paas nikle jabke Aap par us mein se ek qaba tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Hum ne ye tumhare liye chhupaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne us ki taraf dekha. To us ne kaha: Makhraमा raazi hua."
"631","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek jamaat ko diya jabke main un mein baitha tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un mein se ek shakhs ko chhor diya aur use na diya, jabke wo mujhe un mein sab se zyada pasand tha. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas utha aur Aap se sargoshi ki. Phir main ne arz kiya: Falan se tumhe kya hai? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main use momin samajhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Ya musalman. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main thodi der khamosh raha. Phir mujh par jo us mein janta tha ghalib aa gaya. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Falan se tumhe kya hai? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main use momin samajhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Ya musalman. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main thodi der khamosh raha. Phir mujh par jo us mein janta tha ghalib aa gaya. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Falan se tumhe kya hai? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main use momin samajhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Ya musalman. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main shakhs ko deta hun jabke doosra mujhe us se zyada mehboob hota hai, is dar se ke kahin use Aag mein us ke chehre par na gira diya jaye."
"632","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha, jab Allah ne Apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par Hawazin ke malon mein se jo fai farmaya, phir Aap Quraish ke chand mardon ko sau sau oont dene lage. To unhon ne kaha: Allah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bakhshے, Aap Quraish ko dete hain aur hamein chhorte hain, jabke hamari talwarein un ke khoonon se tapak rahi hain. Anas ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un ke qaul ki khabar di gayi. To Aap ne Ansar ki taraf bheja aur unhe chamde ke khaime mein jama kiya. Aur un ke sath un ke siwa kisi ko na bulaya. Phir jab wo jama ho gaye to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum se jo baat mujhe pahunchi hai wo kya thi? To un ke samajhdaron ne Aap se kaha: Rahe hamare samajhdar Ya Rasulullah! Unhon ne kuchh nahi kaha. Aur rahe hum mein se kuchh nau-umr log, unhon ne kaha: Allah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bakhshے, Aap Quraish ko dete hain aur Ansar ko chhorte hain, jabke hamari talwarein un ke khoonon se tapak rahi hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main un mardon ko deta hun jin ka kufr se ahad naya hai. Kya tum raazi nahi ke log malon ke sath jayein aur tum apne rehalon ki taraf Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath lauto? Allah ki qasam! Jo tum lekar lautoge wo us se behtar hai jo wo lekar lautenge. Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Hum raazi ho gaye. Phir Aap ne un se farmaya: Beshak tum mere baad sakht tarjeeh dekhoge. Phir sabr karo yahan tak ke Allah aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Hauz par milo. Anas ne kaha: Phir hum ne sabr na kiya."
"633","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ansar ko bulaya aur farmaya: Kya tum mein tumhare siwa koi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, siwaye hamare bhanje ke. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qaum ka bhanja un mein se hai."
"634","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar ne Makkah ki fatah ke din kaha, jab Aap ne Quraish ko diya: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ye to ta'ajjub hai. Beshak hamari talwarein Quraish ke khoonon se tapak rahi hain, aur hamari ghaneematein un par lautayi jati hain. Phir ye Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahuncha. Phir Aap ne Ansar ko bulaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hai jo mujhe tum se pahuncha hai? Aur wo jhoot na bolte they. Phir unhon ne kaha: Wo hai jo tumhe pahuncha hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ke log ghaneematon ke sath apne gharon ki taraf lautें aur tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath apne gharon ki taraf lauto? Agar Ansar wadi ya ghati mein chalein to main Ansar ki wadi ya ghati mein chalunga."
"635","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hunain ka din tha to Hawazin jama hue, jabke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath dus hazar aur Tulaqa they. Phir wo peeth pher gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Ansar ki jamaat! Unhon ne kaha: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik, labbaik, hum tumhare samne hain. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) utre aur farmaya: Main Allah ka banda aur Us ka Rasool hun. Phir mushrik shikast kha gaye. Phir Aap ne Tulaqa aur Muhajirin ko diya aur Ansar ko kuchh na diya. Phir unhon ne kaha. Phir Aap ne unhe bulaya aur unhe khaime mein dakhil kiya. Phir farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ke log bakri aur oont ke sath jayein aur tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath jao? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar log wadi mein chalein aur Ansar ghati mein chalein to main Ansar ki ghati ko ikhtiyar karunga."
"636","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid bin Asim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ne Apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par Hunain ke din fai farmaya to Aap ne logon mein taqseem kiya, un mein jin ke dil milaye jate hain, aur Ansar ko kuchh na diya. Phir goya unhone bura mana, jab unhe wo na mila jo logon ko mila. Phir Aap ne unhe khutba diya aur farmaya: Ae Ansar ki jamaat! Kya main ne tumhe gumrah na paya phir Allah ne tumhe mere zariye hidayat di? Aur tum muntashir they phir Allah ne tumhe mere zariye jama kiya? Aur mohtaj they phir Allah ne tumhe mere zariye ghani kiya? Jab bhi Aap kuchh farmate to wo kehte: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ka ehsan bada hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab dene se kya rokta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi Aap kuchh farmate to wo kehte: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ka ehsan bada hai. Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to kaho: Tum hamare paas aise aur aise aaye. Kya tum raazi nahi ke log bakri aur oont ke sath jayein aur tum Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath apne rehalon ki taraf jao? Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se ek shakhs hota. Aur agar log wadi aur ghati mein chalein to main Ansar ki wadi aur ghati mein chalunga. Ansar inner garment hain aur log outer garment hain. Beshak tum mere baad tarjeeh paoge. Phir sabr karo yahan tak ke mujh se Hauz par milo."
"637","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hunain ka din tha to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne taqseem mein kuchh logon ko tarjeeh di. Phir Aqra bin Habis ko sau oont diye, Uyaina ko is jaisa diya, aur Arab ke sharifon mein se kuchh logon ko diya. Phir unhe us din taqseem mein tarjeeh di. Unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ye taqseem aisi hai jis mein insaf nahi kiya gaya, aur is se Allah ka chehra nahi chaha gaya. Phir main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar dunga. Phir main Aap ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Phir kaun insaf karega jab Allah aur Us ke Rasool insaf na karein? Allah Musa par rehem farmaye. Unhe is se zyada se takleef di gayi aur unhon ne sabr kiya."
"638","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ji'rana mein ghaneemat taqseem kar rahe they to Aap se ek shakhs ne kaha: Insaf karo. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Main bad-bakht hua agar insaf na karun."
"639","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf sone ki mitti bheji. Phir Aap ne use chaar ke darmiyan taqseem kiya: Aqra bin Habis al-Hanzali phir al-Mujashi'i, Uyaina bin Badr al-Fazari, Zaid al-Ta'i phir Bani Nabhan mein se ek, aur Alqama bin Ulatha al-Amiri phir Bani Kilab mein se ek. Phir Quraish aur Ansar ghazab-naak hue. Unhon ne kaha: Wo Najd ke sardaron ko dete hain aur hamein chhorte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Main to unhe milata hun. Phir ek shakhs aaya jis ki aankhein dhansi hui thein, rukhsar ubhre hue, peshani ubhri hui, dadhi ghani, sar munda hua. Phir us ne kaha: Allah se daro ae Muhammad! To Aap ne farmaya: Jab main na-farmani karun to Allah ki itaat kaun karega? Kya Allah mujhe zameen walon par aman deta hai aur tum mujhe aman nahi dete? Phir Aap se ek shakhs ne us ke qatl ka sawal kiya, mera khayal hai wo Khalid bin al-Walid they. Phir Aap ne use manع farmaya. Phir jab wo peeth pher gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak is ki nasal mein se, ya is ke peechhe, ek qaum hogi jo Quran parhegi jo un ke halaq se na guzrega. Wo deen se nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Wo Ahle Islam ko qatl karenge aur buton walon ko chhorenge. Agar main unhe paun to unhe Aad ke qatl ki tarah qatl karunga."
"640","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf Yemen se chamde mein sone ki mitti bheji jo us ki mitti se saaf nahi ki gayi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne use chaar afrad ke darmiyan taqseem kiya: Uyaina bin Badr, Aqra bin Habis, Zaid al-Khail ke darmiyan, aur chautha ya Alqama ya Amir bin al-Tufail. Phir Aap ke sathiyon mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Hum is ke in se zyada haq-dar they. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ye Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahuncha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mujhe aman nahi dete jabke main us ka ameen hun jo aasman mein hai? Mere paas aasman ki khabar subah aur shaam aati hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ek shakhs khada hua jis ki aankhein dhansi hui thein, rukhsar ubhre hue, peshani uthi hui, dadhi ghani, sar munda hua, tehband upar kiya hua. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se daro. Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Kya main zameen walon mein Allah se darne ka sab se zyada haq-dar nahi? Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo shakhs peeth pher gaya. Khalid bin al-Walid ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main us ki gardan na maar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, shayad wo namaz parhta ho. To Khalid ne kaha: Kitne namazi hain jo apni zaban se kehte hain jo un ke dil mein nahi? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm nahi diya gaya ke main logon ke dilon ko cheerun aur un ke peton ko phaadun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne us ki taraf dekha jabke wo peeth pher raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak is ki nasal se ek qaum niklegi jo Allah ki kitab ko tar parhegi jo un ke halaq se na guzregi. Wo deen se nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Aur mera khayal hai Aap ne farmaya: Agar main unhe paun to unhe Thamud ke qatl ki tarah qatl karunga."
"641","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Tum mein ek qaum niklegi jis ke sath tum apni namaz ko apni namaz se haqeer samjhoge, apne roze ko un ke roze se, apne amal ko un ke amal se. Aur wo Quran parhenge jo un ke halaq se na guzrega. Wo deen se nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Wo teer ke phal mein dekhega aur kuchh na dekhega. Aur lakdi mein dekhega aur kuchh na dekhega. Aur par mein dekhega aur kuchh na dekhega. Aur jod mein shak karega."
"642","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas they jabke Wo taqseem kar rahe they to Aap ke paas Dhu al-Khuwaisira aaya, jo Bani Tamim mein se ek shakhs tha. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Insaf karo. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Aur kaun insaf karega jab main insaf na karun? Tum nakam aur khasare mein rahe agar main insaf na karun. Phir Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe is mein ijazat dijiye ke main us ki gardan maar dun. To Aap ne farmaya: Use chhoro. Beshak us ke sathi honge jin ke sath tum mein se ek apni namaz ko un ki namaz se haqeer samjhega, apne roze ko un ke roze se. Wo Quran parhenge jo un ki hansliyon se na guzrega. Wo deen se nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Us ke phal ki taraf dekha jayega aur us mein kuchh na paya jayega. Phir us ke jod ki taraf dekha jayega aur us mein kuchh na paya jayega. Phir us ki lakdi ki taraf dekha jayega, jo us ka teer hai, aur us mein kuchh na paya jayega. Phir us ke paron ki taraf dekha jayega aur us mein kuchh na paya jayega. Wo gobar aur khoon se aage badh chuka hoga. Un ki alamat ek siyah mard hoga, us ke ek bazu mein se ek aurat ke seene jaisa, ya gosht ke tukde jaisa hilta hua. Aur wo logon ki tafreeq ke waqt niklenge. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Phir main gawahi deta hun ke main ne ye hadith Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni. Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Ali bin Abi Talib ne un se jang ki jabke main un ke sath tha. Phir unhon ne us shakhs ka hukm diya. Phir use talash kiya gaya aur laya gaya, yahan tak ke main ne use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke bataye hue huliye par dekha jo Aap ne bataya tha."
"643","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab main tumhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan karun to aasman se girna mujhe us se zyada mehboob hai ke main Aap par jhoot bolun. Aur jab main tumhe apne aur tumhare darmiyan bayan karun to jang fareb hai. Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Aakhri zamane mein ek qaum aayegi, nau-umr, bewaqoof dimagh wale. Wo makhlooq ke behtareen qaul se kahenge. Wo Islam se nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Un ka iman un ke halaq se na guzrega. Phir tum unhe jahan pao qatl karo. Kyunke un ka qatl Qayamat ke din use qatl karne wale ke liye ajr hai."
"644","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Hunaif se Yusair bin Amr ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sahl bin Hunaif se kaha: Kya tum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Khawarij ke bare mein kuchh farmate suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate suna, aur Aap ne apne hath se Iraq ki taraf ishara farmaya: Us mein se ek qaum niklegi jo Quran parhegi jo un ki hansliyon se na guzrega. Wo Islam se nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai."
"645","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khajooron ke katne ke waqt khajoor layi jati. Phir ye apni khajoor lekar aata, ye apni khajoor mein se. Yahan tak ke Aap ke paas khajoor ka dher ho jata. Phir Hasan aur Husain us khajoor se khelne lage. Phir un mein se ek ne khajoor li aur use apne munh mein rakha. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur use us ke munh se nikala. Phir farmaya: Kya tum nahi jante ke Aal Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sadqa nahi khate?"
"646","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main apne ghar walon ki taraf laut-ta hun aur apne bistar par giri hui khajoor pata hun. Phir use khane ke liye uthata hun. Phir mujhe dar hota hai ke wo sadqa ho. Phir use phenk deta hun."
"647","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) giri hui khajoor ke paas se guzre. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar ye sadqa na hoti to main use khata."
"648","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gosht laya gaya jo Barira par sadqa kiya gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo us par sadqa hai aur hamare liye hadiya hai."
"649","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya al-Ansariya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Aisha ke paas dakhil hue aur farmaya: Kya tumhare paas kuchh hai? To unhon ne kaha: Nahi, siwaye koi cheez jo Nusaiba ne hamein us bakri mein se bheji jo Aap ne sadqe se bheji thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo apni jagah pahunch chuki."
"650","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab khana laya jata to us ke bare mein poochhte: Kya hadiya hai ya sadqa? Phir agar kaha jata sadqa hai to Aap apne sathiyon se farmate: Khayiye, aur Aap na khate. Aur agar kaha jata hadiya hai to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apna hath marte aur un ke sath khate."
"651","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Aap ke paas qaum apna sadqa lekar aati to farmate: Ae Allah! Falan ki aal par rehmat farma. Phir mere walid Aap ke paas apna sadqa lekar aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Aal Abi Aufa par rehmat farma."
